Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.7 stable. Pending tests on other versions once I can use my home PC to test.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.stable - Windows, macOS, and Linux systems.\n\n### Issue description\n\nResources included in both Autoloads and scripts attached to exported scenes are not included in exported game files when exporting with \"Export selected scenes (and dependencies)\".\n\n**NOTE: These files are exported into the game files when they are referenced via an exported script variable.**\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/31060a9e-3f9b-4c1e-98a5-943ac232cda4\n\nDiscovered this issue when my Audio Bus Layout was not included in exported game project, so audio bus volume slider which worked in editor do not function at all in exported game.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Reference a resource via preload in Autoload or script attached to scene marked to be included in export\n- Test if that resource is inside the export, or run the exported game with a console to view dependency errors\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[audio-bus-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29231328/audio-bus-test.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com